        "CONFIRMATIONMOLECULAIRE": "HRL1883 (TENN-F-076401) est l'épitype de l'espèce.\n\n\n\nVizzini A, Consiglio G, Marchetti M, Borovička J, Campo E, Cooper J, Lebeuf R, Ševčíková H. 2022. New data in Porotheleaceae and Cyphellaceae: epitypification of Prunulus scabripes Murrill, the status of Mycopan Redhead, Moncalvo & Vilgalys and a new combination in Pleurella Horak emend. Mycological Progress. 21:44, doi:0.1007/s11557-022-01795-z",
